  "scope": "One previously discovered development projection compared with ordinary continuation from identical independent seeds. Two reversed repetitions, twelve advances and one 32-state allowance per worker. Both paths close original case 1298; projection takes more time and space. Candidate discovery is charged in the preceding study. All worker costs and separate global reconstruction/checking/persistence are retained. Cold replay forbids fresh recognition and reference expansion, validates all arms, full coverage, bridge and split certificates, SAT model lifts, all 3022 reference nodes, deterministic repetitions, idempotent merges and unchanged prior rows. Five acquisition tests cover exact candidate reconstruction, pending/resume/reuse, shared budgets, tampering and support loss. Disk sizes are not peak RAM. No global minimum-cost policy, holdout estimate, efficient arbitrary-SAT classification or P-versus-NP result follows.",
